WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:07.215
(breathing heavily)

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:08.977
- It's not a race.

00:00:08.977 --> 00:00:09.810
- Hey guys.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:10.643
Game night at my house tonight.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:11.476
Coming?

00:00:11.476 --> 00:00:12.495
- I have to go to the gym.

00:00:12.495 --> 00:00:13.328
Hey dude.

00:00:13.328 --> 00:00:14.223
Great job on that project.

00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:15.473
It was so good.

00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:17.713
- Why?

00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:19.656
- Girl, what's with your lunch?

00:00:19.656 --> 00:00:21.104
- I have to eat a certain amount of macros

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.765
with every meal.

00:00:22.765 --> 00:00:25.281
So, there's macro nutrients
and micro nutrients.

00:00:25.281 --> 00:00:27.485
Micro nutrients are like your vitamins.

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:28.318
- Hey, Joy.

00:00:28.318 --> 00:00:29.151
Wanna fry?

00:00:29.151 --> 00:00:29.984
- No.

00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:30.817
- Here we go guys.

00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:32.650
Just a few more miles.

00:00:35.854 --> 00:00:37.835
I eat a certain amount of
each one with every meal.

00:00:37.835 --> 00:00:40.626
So I need 18 grams of protein.

00:00:40.626 --> 00:00:41.938
That's why I have the chicken.

00:00:41.938 --> 00:00:43.812
And then I need vegetables
with every meal.

00:00:43.812 --> 00:00:46.318
- Wanna hand out on Saturday with me?

00:00:46.318 --> 00:00:47.391
- I have to go to the gym.

00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:48.730
- All day?

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.475
- Let's have a lazy weekend.

00:00:50.475 --> 00:00:52.511
- Yeah, with Netflix and pizza.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:54.813
- No. I think we should go on a hike.

00:00:54.813 --> 00:00:56.803
We need to get outside
and move our bodies.

00:00:56.803 --> 00:00:57.885
Burn some calories.

00:00:57.885 --> 00:00:59.664
Sweat a little bit.

00:00:59.664 --> 00:01:00.997
Here we go guys.

00:01:02.064 --> 00:01:04.363
A couple more sets.

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:06.523
Squeeze those abs.

00:01:06.523 --> 00:01:07.773
Chest to knees.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:09.667
- Oh, God.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.500
This hurts so much.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.333
- You got it.

00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:12.166
Nice work.

00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:12.999
- My abs.

00:01:12.999 --> 00:01:13.832
- Just embrace the pain.

00:01:13.832 --> 00:01:14.960
- So tough.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.013
- We'll be done soon.

00:01:16.013 --> 00:01:17.053
- I don't know if I can do anymore.

00:01:17.053 --> 00:01:18.380
- You guys are doing great work.

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:20.463
(laughs)

